body:
Goonji thi jo karbal me halmin ki sada hai;;;
Gham khwar hain Maula ke ham hi ahle aza hain;;;
Socho ye azadaron, shabbir ke gham khwaron !!!!!
Kya ham hi Sayyida ki dua hain?
Bibi ne sikhaya tha jo majlis ka tareeqa;;;
Hamne to badal daala hai ab iska tareeqa;;;
Apnayi dikhawat ki banawat ki rusumaat;;;
Aur inko bhi kahte hain ibadat ka tareeqa;;;
Kya ham hi Sayyida ki dua hain?
Taqleed pe ham log bharosa nahin karte;;;
Gheebat hai bura kaam yahi kaam hi karte;;;
Naaraz na ho jayen kahin aale Muhammad (as);;;
Is baat ki parwaah magar ham nahin karte;;;
Kya ham hi Sayyida ki dua hain?
Padhte nahin qur'aan namaze'n nahin padhte;;;
Wajib hain jo ahkam ada wo nahin karte;;;
Rakhte hain aqeedat pe hi bakhshish ka bharosa;;;
Momin ye kabhi kaam kiya hi nahin karte;;;
Kya ham hi Sayyida ki dua hain?
Masjid me siyasat hai to mimbar pe siyasat;;;
Mahfil me siyasat hai to majlis me siyasat;;;
Kirdaar kashi karne me ham sabse hain aage;;;
Ab isse badi kya ho bhala aur qayamat;;;
Kya ham hi Sayyida ki dua hain?
Majlis me ghame shaah ki karte hain dikhawe;;;
Maqsad ko bhula baithe hain ham karbobala ke;;;
Farshe aza pe ab na aqeedat na ehtraam;;;
Jiddat pasandi aa gayi ikhlaas bhula ke;;;
Kya ham hi Sayyida ki dua hain?
Maa bahno ke sar pe hamein chadar nahin dikhti;;;
Na mahramo ko dekh ke gardan nahin jhhukti;;;
Aati hain muharram me har ek ghar meri Bibi;;;
Ye dekh ke halaat wo kya sochti hongi;;;
Kya ham hi Sayyida ki dua hain?
Ham log azadar hain karte hain ye charche;;;
Khoon e gham e Shabbir ke ham karte hain saude;;;
Maulana ho zakir ho ya masjid ke nigehbaan;;;
Kirdaar o amal apna khara ham nahin karte;;;
Kya ham hi Sayyida ki dua hain?
Wo izn agar dete hain ham padhte hain nauhe;;;
Wo izn agar dete hain ham likhte hain nauhe;;;
Ham apni numaish me magan aaj hain aise;;;
Fankaar bane baithe hain ham zikr ke inse;;;
Kya ham hi Sayyida ki dua hain?
Socho ye azadaron ye tanhayi me jakar;;;
Kis baat pe tanqeed hui ham pe ye aakhir;;;
Ham door karein saari burayi ko amal se;;;
Ek jaisa banayen chalo ham baatin o zaahir;;;
Kya ham hi Sayyida ki dua hain?
Khush ho gayin Bibi to duaen hamein dengi;;;
Jannat me momino se wo jab aake milengi;;;
Kirdaar o amal se jo kiya hamne ye saabit;;;
Phir dekhna ye Fatima Zahra bhi kahengi;;;
Haa'n tum hi Sayyida ki dua ho!!!!
Haa'n tum hi Sayyida ki dua ho!!!!
